  {
   "text": "Snow started on the ridge.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.698
  },
  {
   "text": "Claire walked on, sure the next marker was close. It wasn't.",
   "start": 1.948,
   "end": 5.194
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: if you can't see the next marker, stop and go back to the last one you saw.",
   "start": 5.444,
   "end": 10.224
  },
  {
   "text": "Then decide.",
   "start": 10.474,
   "end": 11.401
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next winter hike.",
   "start": 11.651,
   "end": 13.506
  }
